# AuraGlass {{version}}

> React 19 component system with a layered glass material (`aura-glass`). Import components by canonical name, style them through `data-ag-part` and `data-state` attributes and the `ag` cascade layer, and add certified registry blocks with `@auraglass/cli`. This file is generated from `package.json`, the exports manifest and the component metas; version {{version}}.

## Install

- `npm install {{install}}`
- `npx @auraglass/cli init` (writes `auraglass.json` and the `aura-glass/styles.css` import plus layer statement)
- `npx @auraglass/cli add <block>` (shadcn-format registry items)
- Upgrading from 4.x: `npx @auraglass/cli migrate 4to5 --dry-run`
- MCP server for agents: `npx @auraglass/mcp` (stdio; tools `search_components`, `get_component`, `list_registry`, `get_registry_item`, `get_migration`)

